content:
Nanso nnebɔneyɛfoɔ nte saa;
    wɔte sɛ ntɛtɛ a
    mframa bɔ guo.

Nʼakwan nyinaa mu, ɔdi yie;
    ɔma ne ho so, na wo mmara mfa ne ho;
    na ɔdi nʼatamfoɔ nyinaa ho fɛw.

Ɔtɛ wɔ nkuraase;
    ɔfiri atɛeɛ kum deɛ ɔnnim hwee,
    na ɔhwɛ wɔn a ɔrepɛ wɔn akum wɔn.

Ɔte sɛ gyata a wahinta;
    ɔtɛ sɛ ɔbɛkyere mmɔborɔni;
    ɔkyere wɔn twe wɔn ase de wɔn kɔ ne bɔn mu.

Nanso wo, Ao Onyankopɔn, wohunu amanehunu ne ɔhaw;
    na wayɛ wʼadwene sɛ wobɛhwɛ.
  Mmɔborɔni de ne ho ma wo;
    wo na woyɛ awisiaa ɔboafoɔ.

Bubu omumuyɛfoɔ ne ɔbɔnefoɔ aprɛ;
    frɛ no na ɔmmɛbu nʼamumuyɛ ho nkontaa,
    amumuyɛ a anka wɔrenhunu no.

Monhunu sɛ Awurade yɛ Onyankopɔn;
    ɔno na ɔyɛɛ yɛn, na yɛyɛ ne dea;
    yɛyɛ ne nkurɔfoɔ ne nʼadidibea nnwan.

Momfa aseda nhyɛne nʼapono mu
    na momfa nkamfo nkɔ nʼadihɔ;
    momfa aseda mma no, na monkamfo ne din.

Wobɛsɔre na woahunu Sion mmɔbɔ;
    berɛ aduru sɛ wohunu no mmɔbɔ;
    ɛberɛ a wohyɛeɛ no aso.

Enti mekaa sɛ,
    “Ao me Onyankopɔn, mfa me nkɔ, wɔ me nkwa nna mfimfini;
    wo mfeɛ wɔ hɔ daa kɔduru awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ nyinaa mu.

Ao Awurade, wo nnwuma dɔɔso!
    Nyansa mu na woyɛɛ ne nyinaa;
    wʼabɔdeɛ ahyɛ asase so ma.

Monkamfo Awurade!

  Monna Awurade ase na ɔyɛ;
    na nʼadɔeɛ wɔ hɔ daa.

Gilead yɛ me dea; Manase nso saa ara;
    Efraim yɛ me dadeɛ kyɛ,
    Yuda yɛ mʼahempoma.

Moab yɛ me dwaresɛn,
    Edom so na meto me mpaboa guo;
    Filistia so na mebɔ ose.”

na amumuyɛfoɔ ne nkontompofoɔ
    atu wɔn ano agu me so;
    wɔde atorɔ tɛkrɛma akasa atia me.

Ɔhyɛɛ nnome sɛ atadeɛ;
    ɛnonom kɔɔ ne onipadua mu sɛ nsuo,
    ne ne nnompe mu sɛ ngo.

Nanso, wo Ao Asafo Awurade,
    wo din enti, wo ne me nni no yie;
    firi wʼadɔeɛ mu gye me.

Wɔbɛdome, nanso wobɛhyira;
    sɛ wɔto hyɛ me so a, wɔn anim bɛgu ase,
    nanso wo ɔsomfoɔ ani bɛgye.

Ɔbɛtɔ gyaframa ne sɔfe a ɛrederɛ
    agu Amumuyɛfoɔ so;
    na mframa a emu yɛ hyeɛ bɛyɛ wɔn kyɛfa.

Awurade yɛ ɔteneneeni,
    na ɔpɛ atɛntenenee;
    wɔn a wɔtene no bɛhunu nʼanim.

Ɔde ɔgyeɛ maa ne nkurɔfoɔ;
    ɔde nʼapam sii hɔ afebɔɔ,
    ne din yɛ kronkron na ɛyɛ hu.

Awurade suro yɛ nyansa mfitiaseɛ;
    wɔn a wɔdi nʼahyɛdeɛ so nyinaa wɔ nhunumu pa.
    Ɔno na daa ayɛyie wɔ no.

Ɔto nʼakyɛdeɛ pete aman so ma ahiafoɔ,
    ne tenenee wɔ hɔ daa;
    wɔbɛkae wɔn daa na wɔahyɛ wɔn animuonyam.

Omumuyɛfoɔ bɛhunu ama ayɛ no yea,
    ɔbɛtwere ne se na wafɔn;
    omumuyɛfoɔ tirimpɔ bɛyɛ kwa.

Wɔwɔ nsa, nanso wɔnte nka;
    Wɔwɔ nan, nanso wɔnnante.
  Wɔntumi mma nnyegyeeɛ bi mfiri wɔn mene mu.

Na wo, Ao Awurade, woagye me kra afiri owuo mu;
    woamma mʼani amporo nisuo,
    na woamma me nan ansunti,

Ao Awurade, ampa ara meyɛ wo ɔsomfoɔ;
    meyɛ wo ɔsomfoɔ, wʼafenaa babarima;
    wayi me afiri me mpɔkyerɛ mu.

Wɔkyere guu me so sɛ nwowa,
    nanso wɔhyee ntɛm so sɛ nkasɛɛ a ogya atɔ mu;
    Awurade din mu metwitwaa wɔn guiɛ.

Awurade nhyira wo mfiri Sion
    wo nkwa nna nyinaa;
    na ɔmma wo nhunu Yerusalem nkɔsoɔ,

Mma wɔn a wɔtwam hɔ nnka sɛ,
    “Awurade nhyira mmra mo so;
    yɛhyira mo wɔ Awurade din mu.”

Monkamfo Awurade.

  Monkamfo Awurade din;
    monkamfo no, mo Awurade asomfoɔ,

Ɔma omununkum ma ne ho so firi asase ano ba;
    ɔsoma anyinam ka osutɔ ho
    na ɔma ahum tu firi nʼakoradan mu.

ɛhɔ na yɛn nnommumfafoɔ bisaa yɛn nnwom,
    yɛn ahohiahiafoɔ pɛɛ yɛn hɔ ahurisie nnwom;
    wɔkaa sɛ, “Monto Sion nnwom baako mma yɛn!”

Awurade bɛma deɛ wahyehyɛ ama me no aba mu;
    Ao Awurade, wʼadɔeɛ wɔ hɔ daa,
    nnyaa wo nsa ano adwuma hɔ.

esum mpo nnyɛ sum mma wo;
    na anadwo bɛhyerɛn sɛ awia;
    esum ne hann yɛ wo pɛ.

Wɔamfa me bɔberɛ anhinta wo
    ɛberɛ a wɔyɛɛ me kɔkoam no;
  ɛberɛ a wɔnwonoo me asase yam no,

Ao Awurade, yi me firi amumuyɛfoɔ nsam;
    bɔ me ho ban firi basabasayɛfoɔ a
    wɔdwene sɛ wɔbɛtwintwan mʼanan mu.

Ahantanfoɔ asum me afidie;
    wɔatrɛtrɛ wɔn asau nhoma mu,
    wɔasunsum me mfidie wɔ me kwan so.

Ma nnyasrama ngu wɔn so;
    ma wɔnto wɔn ngu ogya mu,
    ngu atɛkyɛ amena mu a wɔrensɔre bio.

Hwɛ me nifa so na hunu sɛ;
    mʼasɛm mfa obiara ho;
  menni dwanekɔbea bi;
    me nkwa mfa obiara ho.

Ao Awurade, mesu mefrɛ wo;
    mese, “Wone me dwanekɔbea,
    me kyɛfa wɔ ateasefoɔ asase so.”

Mekae tete nna no;
    medwendwene wo nnwuma
    ne deɛ wo nsa ayɛ nyinaa ho.

Wɔ wʼadɔeɛ a ɛnsa da no mu, yi mʼatamfoɔ hɔ;
    na sɛe wɔn a wɔkyiri me nyinaa,
    na meyɛ wo ɔsomfoɔ.

Ɔde omununkum kata ɔsoro ani;
    ɔde osutɔ ma asase
    ma ɛserɛ nyini wɔ nkokoɔ so.

Ɔnyɛɛ yei mmaa aman foforɔ biara;
    wɔnnim ne mmara.

  Monkamfo Awurade!

Ma wɔnkamfo Awurade din,
    na ne din so sene edin biara;
    nʼanimuonyam korɔn wɔ asase ne ɔsoro so.

Monkamfo Awurade.

  Monkamfo Awurade wɔ ne kronkronbea;
    monkamfo no wɔ ɔsoro tumi mu.

Meka kyerɛɛ Awurade sɛ,
    “MʼAwurade ne wo;
    menni adepa biara ka wo ho.”

Mesu mefrɛ wo, Ao Onyankopɔn
    na wobɛgye me so;
    yɛ aso ma me na tie me mpaeɛbɔ.

Sɔre, Ao Awurade!
    Wone wɔn mfa mmɔ ani na ka wɔn hyɛ;
    fa wʼakofena no gye me firi amumuyɛfoɔ no nsam.

Awurade ne me botantim;
    mʼaban ne me gyefoɔ;
  me Onyankopɔn ne me botan
    Ne mu na menya me hintabea.
    Ɔyɛ mʼakokyɛm, me nkwagyeɛ abɛn ne mʼabandenden.

Wisie firii ne hwene mu;
    ogyaframa firii nʼanom,
    na egyasramma dɛre firii mu.

Woagye me afiri nnipa no ntohyɛsoɔ mu,
    woayɛ me amanaman no ti;
    nnipa a mennim wɔn abɛyɛ mʼasomfoɔ.

Wode nkonimdie akɛseɛ ama wo ɔhene;
    woda ɔdɔ a ɛnsa da adi kyerɛ deɛ woasra no ngo,
    wode kyerɛ Dawid, ne nʼasefoɔ afebɔɔ.

Ɛpue wɔ ɔsoro fa baabi
    na atwa ne ho akɔsi ano;
    biribiara nhinta ne hyeɛ.

Awurade ahyɛdeɛ tene;
    ɛma akoma mu anigyeɛ.
  Awurade ɔhyɛ nsɛm mu da hɔ;
    na ɛbue ani.

Mɛpae mu aka Awurade ahyɛdeɛ:
  Ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Woyɛ me Babarima;
    ɛnnɛ mayɛ wʼAgya.

Afei mahunu sɛ Awurade gye deɛ wasra no no nkwa;
    ɔgye no so wɔ ne soro kronkron hɔ
    ɔde tumi a ɛfiri ne nsa nifa mu no ma no nkwagyeɛ.

Ɔhene no de ne ho to Awurade so;
    Ɔsorosoroni no nokorɛ dɔ no enti,
    Ɔhene renhinhim.

Ahiafoɔ bɛdidi na wɔamee;
    wɔn a wɔhwehwɛ Awurade bɛyi no ayɛ.
    Mo akoma nnya nkwa daa.

Asase so adefoɔ nyinaa bɛdidi na wɔasɔre no;
    wɔn a wɔkɔ dɔteɛ mu nyinaa bɛbu nkotodwe nʼanim,
    wɔn a wɔrentumi mma nkwa mu.

Hwan ne saa Animuonyam Ɔhene yi?
    Ɔno ne Awurade ɔhoɔdenfoɔ ne otumfoɔ no;
    Awurade a ɔyɛ ɔko mu nkonimdifoɔ.

Adeɛ baako na mebisa Awurade;
    na ɛno na mehwehwɛ;
  sɛ mɛtena Awurade fie
    me nkwa nna nyinaa,
  na mahwɛ Awurade ahoɔfɛ
    na mahwehwɛ no wɔ nʼasɔrefie.

Afei ɔbɛma me tiri so
    wɔ atamfoɔ a wɔatwa me ho ahyia no so;
  mede anigyeɛ bɛbɔ afɔdeɛ wɔ nʼAhyiaeɛ Ntomadan mu;
    na mɛto dwom, ahyehyɛ nnwom ama Awurade.

Kyerɛ me wʼakwan, Ao Awurade;
    fa me fa ɛkwan tee so,
    me nhyɛsofoɔ enti.

Twe wɔn aso wɔ deɛ wɔayɛ no so;
    wɔn adwuma bɔne no so;
  tua deɛ wɔde wɔn nsa ayɛ so ka
    na fa deɛ ɛfata wɔn sane bra wɔn so.

Awurade nne wɔ nsuo no so;
    animuonyam Onyankopɔn bobom,
  Awurade bobom wɔ nsuo akɛseɛ so.

Monto ayɛyie nnwom mma Awurade;
    mo a moyɛ nʼahotefoɔ!
  Monkamfo ne din kronkron no.

Wodanee mʼagyaadwotwa yɛɛ no asa;
    woyii mʼayitoma firii me ho
    na wode anigyeɛ firaa me,

Wo mu, Ao Awurade, na manya hintabea;
    mma mʼanim ngu ase;
    firi wo tenenee mu gye me.

Hu me mmɔbɔ, Ao Awurade, ɛfiri sɛ me ho yera me;
    awerɛhoɔ ama mʼani so ayɛ kusuu
    ɛyea ama me kra ne me honam ayɛ mmerɛ.

Wone me hintabea;
    wobɛbɔ me ho ban wɔ amanehunu mu
    na wode nkwagyeɛ nnwom atwa me ho ahyia.

Nanso, ɛberɛ a mesuntiiɛ no, wɔde anigyeɛ boaa wɔn ho ano;
    ntohyɛsofoɔ twaa me ho hyiaaɛ a mennim
    na wɔdii me ho nsekuro a wɔantwa so da.

Ɔda ne mpa so mpo a, ɔbɔ pɔ bɔne;
    na ɔgyaa ne ho ma bɔne ɛkwan
    na ɔmpo deɛ ɛnyɛ.

Nanso, amumuyɛfoɔ bɛyera.
    Awurade atamfoɔ bɛyɛ te sɛ wiram nhwiren;
    wɔbɛtu ayera sɛ wisie.

Awurade boa wɔn na ɔgye wɔn;
    ɔyi wɔn firi amumuyɛfoɔ nsam na ɔgye wɔn nkwa,
    ɛfiri sɛ wɔhinta wɔ ne mu.

“Ao Awurade, ma menhunu me nkwa awieeɛ
    ne me nna dodoɔ;
  ma menhunu sɛdeɛ me nkwa twa mu ntɛm so.

Woayɛ me nna sɛ nsateakwaa baako pɛ;
    na me mfeɛ dodoɔ nyɛ hwee wɔ wʼani so.
    Onipa nkwa yɛ ahomeɛ bi kɛkɛ.

Onipa redi akɔneaba nyinaa no, ɔte sɛ sunsum bi kwa;
    ɔha ne ho, nanso ɔyɛ kwa;
    ɔboa ahonya ano, na ɔnnim deɛ ɛbɛyɛ ne dea.

Woka nnipa anim, na wotwe wɔn aso wɔ wɔn bɔne ho;
    wosɛe wɔn ahonya te sɛ nweweboa
    onipa biara yɛ ahomeɛ kɛkɛ.

Mo bo fu a, monnyɛ bɔne;
    sɛ modeda mo mpa so a,
    monyɛ komm na monhwehwɛ mo akoma mu.

Wompɛ afɔrebɔ ne ayɛyɛdeɛ,
    woabue mʼaso ama mahunu;
    woampɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ne bɔne afɔdeɛ.

Meka wo tenenee ho asɛm wɔ dwabɔ kɛseɛ ase;
    meremmua mʼano,
    Ao Awurade, sɛdeɛ wonim no.

Nanso meyɛ ohiani ne mmɔborɔni;
    ma Awurade nnwene me ho.
  Wone me ɔboafoɔ ne me gyefoɔ;
    Ao me Onyankopɔn, bra ntɛm.

Awurade bɛbɔ ne ho ban na wakora ne kra.
    Ɔbɛhyira no wɔ asase no so;
    ɔrennyaa no mma nʼatamfoɔ apɛdeɛ.

Ɛberɛ biara a obi ba me nkyɛn no,
    ɔka atorɔsɛm, na nʼakoma hɔre dinsɛeɛ;
    ɔfiri adi kɔ a, ɔde kɔdi nsekuro.

Adekyeɛ mu Awurade kyerɛ nʼadɔeɛ;
    adesaeɛ mu ne dwom ba me nkyɛn.
    Mebɔ mpaeɛ kyerɛ Onyankopɔn a ɔma me nkwa.

Ao Onyankopɔn, bu me bem,
    na ka mʼasɛm a ɛtia ɔman a wɔnnsuro wo no ma me;
    gye me firi nnaadaafoɔ ne amumuyɛfoɔ nsam.

Ao Onyankopɔn, yɛde yɛn aso ate;
    yɛn agyanom aka akyerɛ yɛn;
  deɛ woyɛeɛ wɔ wɔn berɛ so,
    wɔ tete mmerɛ no mu.

Botaeɛ bi a ɛdi mu akanyane mʼakoma
    ɛberɛ a merebɔ ɔhene mmrane no;
    me tɛkrɛma yɛ ɔtwerɛfoɔ kunini bi twerɛdua.

Fa wo kɛseyɛ mu kɔ wʼanim nkonimdie so
    wɔ nokorɛ, ahobrɛaseɛ ne tenenee mu;
    ma wo nsa nifa nna wo nnwuma a ɛyɛ nwanwa no adi.

Kurobo, pɛperɛ ne bɛwewonua hwa agye wo batakari mu nyinaa;
    sankuo so nnwom a ɛfiri ahemfie a wɔde asonse asiesie ho mu
    ma wʼani gye.

Ɔhyɛ ntadeɛ a wɔadi mu adwinneɛ na wɔde no kɔma ɔhene;
    ne mfɛfoɔ mmaabunu di nʼakyi
    na wɔde wɔn nyinaa brɛ wo.

Ɔma akodie gyae kɔsi asase ano.
    Ɔbubu agyan mu na ɔsɛe pea;
    ɔde ogya hye nkataboɔ.

Monyɛ komm na monhunu sɛ me ne Onyankopɔn;
    wɔbɛma me so wɔ amanaman no mu,
    wɔbɛma me so wɔ asase so.

Ao Onyankopɔn, wʼayɛyie duru asase ano
    te sɛ wo din;
    tenenee ayɛ wo nsa nifa mu ma.

Obiara nim pefee sɛ anyansafoɔ wu;
    saa ara na nkwaseafoɔ ne agyimifoɔ nso wuo
    na wɔgya wɔn ahonya hɔ ma afoforɔ.

Ao, Awurade, wote me nne anɔpa;
    anɔpa, mede mʼadesrɛ ba wʼanim
    na mede anidasoɔ twɛn.

Wosɛe wɔn a wɔka atorɔsɛm;
    Awurade kyiri
    mogyapɛfoɔ ne asisifoɔ.

Yɛn Onyankopɔn reba nanso ɔrenyɛ komm;
    ogya a ɛhye nneɛma di nʼanim,
    ahum a ɛretu atwa ne ho ahyia.

“Montie, me nkurɔfoɔ na mɛkasa,
    mɛdi adanseɛ atia wo, Ao Israel;
    Mene Onyankopɔn, wo Onyankopɔn no.

Afei afɔrebɔ a ɛho teɛ bɛba,
    ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ a ɛdi mu a ɛbɛsɔ wʼani;
    na wɔde anantwinini bɛbɔ afɔdeɛ wʼafɔrebukyia so.

Wo tɛkrɛma bɔ ɔsɛeɛ ho pɔ;
    ɛte sɛ yiwan a ano yɛ tahwetahwe.
  Wo a wotwa nkontompo nko ara.

Ampa ara, Onyankopɔn de ɔsɛeɛ a ɛnni awieeɛ bɛbrɛ wo;
    ɔbɛtwe wo afiri wo ntomadan mu na watete wo mu;
    Ɔbɛtɔre wʼase wɔ ateasefoɔ asase so.

Mɛyi wo ayɛ daa wɔ deɛ woayɛ nti;
    wo din so na mʼani bɛda, ɛfiri sɛ ɛyɛ.
    Mɛyi wo ayɛ wɔ wʼahotefoɔ anim.

Obiara amane;
    wɔn nyinaa ayɛ bɔne;
  wɔn mu bi nni hɔ a ɔyɛ papa;
    ɔbaako mpo nni hɔ.

Ahɔhoɔ reto ahyɛ me so.
    Atirimuɔdenfoɔ repɛ me akum me;
    nnipa a wɔmmfa Onyankopɔn nyɛ hwee.

Mɛfiri me pɛ mu abɔ afɔdeɛ ama wo;
    Ao Awurade, mɛyi wo din ayɛ,
    ɛfiri sɛ ɛyɛ.

wɔ deɛ mʼatamfoɔ reka
    ne sɛdeɛ amumuyɛfoɔ hwɛ me haa nti;
  wɔde amanehunu brɛ me;
    na wɔde abufuo sopa me.

Ma owuo mmɛfa mʼatamfoɔ mpofirim;
    ma wɔnkɔ damena mu anikann,
    ɛfiri sɛ bɔne te wɔn mu.

Fa wo haw to Awurade so
    na ɔno na ɔbɛgye wo;
    ɔremma ɔteneneeni nhwe ase.

Twerɛ me kwadwom to hɔ;
    sese me nisuo wɔ wo nwoma mmobɔeɛ no mu.
    Ɛnni deɛ woatwerɛ ato hɔ no mu anaa?

Ɔsoma firi soro hɔ bɛgye me nkwa,
    ɔka wɔn a wɔtaa me anibereɛ so no anim;
    Onyankopɔn soma ne dɔ ne ne nokorɛ.

Ao Onyankopɔn, mʼakoma agyina pintinn,
    mʼakoma nhinhim;
    mɛto dwom na mayi wo ayɛ.

Ao Asafo Awurade Onyankopɔn, Israel Onyankopɔn,
    ma wo ho so na twe amanaman no nyinaa aso;
    nhunu amumuyɛfoɔ nkontompofoɔ no mmɔbɔ.

Hu me mmɔbɔ, Awurade, ɛfiri sɛ meyɛ mmrɛ;
    Ao Awurade sa me yadeɛ
    na me nnompe wɔ ahoyera mu.

Mʼatamfoɔ nyinaa anim bɛgu ase
    na wɔn ho adwiri wɔn;
    na wɔapatu de fɛreɛ asane wɔn akyi.

Gilead wɔ me, Manase wɔ me;
    Efraim yɛ me dadeɛ kyɛ,
    ɛna Yuda yɛ mʼahempoma.

Moab yɛ me dwaresɛn,
    Edom so na meto me mpaboa guo;
    na meteam nkonimdie so gu Filistifoɔ so.”

Mefiri asase ano frɛ wo,
    mefrɛ wo ɛfiri sɛ mʼakoma atɔ baha;
    fa me kɔ ɔbotan a ɛware sene me no so.

Ao me nkurɔfoɔ, momfa mo ho nto ne so daa;
    monka mo akoma mu nsɛm nyinaa nkyerɛ no,
    ɛfiri sɛ Onyankopɔn ne yɛn dwanekɔbea.

Nnipa nyinaa te sɛ home;
    akɛseɛ ne nkumaa nyinaa nka hwee;
  sɛ wɔkari wɔn wɔ nsania so a, wɔnka hwee;
    wɔn nyinaa bɔ mu a, wɔyɛ home mu tutuo.

Nanso ɔhene bɛdi ahurisie wɔ Onyankopɔn mu;
    wɔn a wɔka ntam wɔ Onyankopɔn din mu nyinaa bɛkamfo no,
    na wɔbɛmua atorofoɔ ano.

Wɔhyehyɛ wɔn ho wɔn ho nkuran wɔ wɔn amumuyɛ nneyɛeɛ ho,
    wɔka sɛdeɛ wɔbɛsum afidie;
    wɔka sɛ, “Hwan na ɔbɛhunu yɛn?”

Ɔbɛdane wɔn ankasa tɛkrɛma atia wɔn
    na ɔde wɔn aba ɔsɛeɛ mu;
    na wɔn a wɔbɛhunu wɔn nyinaa bɛbɔ wɔn tiri nko wɔ animtiabuo so.

Adasamma nyinaa bɛsuro;
    wɔbɛpae mu aka Onyankopɔn nnwuma
    na wɔasusu deɛ wayɛ ho.

Ma teneneefoɔ nni ahurisie wɔ Awurade mu
    na wɔmpɛ hintabea wɔ ne mu;
    ma wɔn a wɔn akoma mu teɛ nyinaa nyi no ayɛ!

Nnwankuo ahyɛ adidibea hɔ ma
    na ayuo akata mmɔnhwa no so;
    wɔbɔ ose, to ahosɛpɛ dwom.

Asase nyinaa koto wo;
    wɔto ayɛyi dwom ma wo,
    wɔto dwom kamfo wo din.”

Ɔmaa ɛpo yɛɛ asase kesee;
    wɔnante twaa asuo no.
    Mommra na yɛnni ahurisie wɔ ne mu.

Womaa yɛn atamfoɔ twi faa yɛn so;
    yɛfaa ogya ne nsuo mu,
    nanso wode yɛn baa baabi a nnepa abu so.

Mede mmoa a wɔadɔ sradeɛ bɛbɔ afɔdeɛ ama wo
    nnwennini ayɛyɛdeɛ;
    mede anantwinini ne mpapo bɛbɔ afɔdeɛ.

Nanso, ma ateneneefoɔ ani nnye
    na wɔnsɛpɛ wɔn ho wɔ Onyankopɔn anim;
    ma wɔn ho ntɔ wɔn na wɔnni ahurisie.

Ɔma onnibie tena mmusua mu,
    na ɔde nnwontoɔ yi nneduafoɔ ma wɔde wɔn ho;
    na atuatefoɔ deɛ, wɔtena asase a awo so.

Onyankopɔn nteaseɛnam yɛ ɔpedu mpem mpem
    ne ɔpepem mpem mpem;
    Awurade firi Sinai aba ne kronkronbea.

Wo ho yɛ nwanwa, Onyankopɔn, wɔwo kronkronbea hɔ;
    Israel Onyankopɔn de tumi ne ahoɔden ma ne nkurɔfoɔ.

  Ayɛyie nka Onyankopɔn!

ɛfiri sɛ Onyankopɔn bɛgye Sion nkwa
    na wakyekyere Yuda nkuropɔn no bio.
  Afei nnipa bɛtena mu na ayɛ wɔn dea;

Ao, Awurade me Onyankopɔn,
    medwane metoa wo;
    Gye me firi wɔn a wɔtaa me nyinaa nsam,

ɛnneɛ ma mʼatamfoɔ ntaa me na wɔmmɛto me;
    ma wɔntiatia me so wɔ fam
    na wɔmma me funu nna mfuturo mu.

Sɛ wansesa nʼadwene a,
    ɔbɛse nʼakofena ano;
    ɔbɛkuntunu ne tadua na ɔde bɛmma ahyɛ mu.

Meyɛ ohiani a menni ɔboafoɔ;
    Ao Onyankopɔn, bra me nkyɛn ntɛm.
  Wo ne me ɔboafoɔ ne me gyefoɔ;
    Ao Awurade, ntwentwɛn wo nan ase.

Ɛfiri awoɔ mu, mede me ho ato wo so;
    wo na woyii me firii me maame yafunu mu.
    Mɛkamfo wo daa.

Wɔka sɛ, “Onyankopɔn agya no mu;
    momma yɛnti no na yɛnkyere no,
    na obiara nni hɔ a ɔbɛgye no.”

Ma wɔn a wɔbɔ me soboɔ no nsɛe animguaseɛ mu;
    wɔn a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔpira me no
    ma ahohora ne animguaseɛ nkata wɔn so.

Mmom woama mahunu ɔhaw bebree a ɛyɛ yea;
    nanso wobɛma me nkwa bio;
  na wobɛyi me bio
    afiri asase ase.

Ɔbɛko ama nnipa no mu amanehunufoɔ
    na woagye wɔn a wɔnni bie mma nkwa;
    ɔbɛdwerɛ nhyɛsofoɔ.

Aburoo mmu so wɔ asase no so nyinaa;
    nnuane mmu so wɔ nkokoɔ so,
    ma nʼaba mmɔ sɛ Lebanon;
  na ɛnyini sɛ mfuo so serɛ.

Nanso, me deɛ, menim sɛ ɛyɛ sɛ wɔbɛbɛn Onyankopɔn.
    Mede Otumfoɔ Awurade ayɛ me hintabea;
    mɛka wo nneyɛɛ nyinaa akyerɛ.

Yɛnhunu wo nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛyɛ nwanwa biara bio;
    adiyifoɔ no nyinaa asa,
    na yɛn mu biara nnim nna dodoɔ a ɛbɛdie.

Ao Onyankopɔn, yɛda wo ase,
    yɛda wo ase, ɛfiri sɛ wo Din abɛn;
    nnipa ka wʼanwanwadeɛ kyerɛ.

Monhyɛ Awurade mo Onyankopɔn no bɔ na monni so;
    momma nsase a atwa ne ho ahyia
    mfa ayɛyɛdeɛ mmrɛ Ɔbaako a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔsuro noɔ no.

Ɛberɛ a mewɔ ahohiahia mu no, mehwehwɛɛ Awurade;
    metrɛɛ me nsa a ɛmpa aba mu anadwo
    na me kra ampene sɛ wɔbɛkyekye ne werɛ.

Ao Onyankopɔn, nsuo no hunuu wo,
    nsuo no hunuu wo na wɔpopoeɛ;
    ebunu no mpo ho wosoeɛ.

Omununkum tɔɔ nsuo,
    aprannaa gyegyee wɔ soro;
    na wo bɛmma twaa ogya dii akɔneaba.

Wʼaprannaa boboom wɔ twahoframa no mu,
    wʼanyinam hyerɛn ewiase;
    asase popoeɛ na ɛwosoeɛ.

Yɛremfa nkame wɔn mma;
    yɛbɛka akyerɛ nkyirimma;
  Awurade nneyɛɛ a ɛfata nkamfo no,
    ne tumi ne anwanwadeɛ a wayɛ no.

Ɛberɛ a Awurade tee deɛ wɔreka no, ne bo fuu yie;
    ne ogya bɛguu Yakob so,
    na nʼabufuhyeɛ sɔre tiaa Israel,

Onyankopɔn abufuo sɔree wɔn so;
    ɔkum ahoɔdenfoɔ a wɔwɔ wɔn mu
    twitwaa Israel mmeranteɛ guiɛ.

Ɔhwiee nʼabufuhyeɛ guu wɔn so,
    abufuo, anibereɛ ne ahohia;
    abɔfoɔ asɛefoɔ kuo no.

Ɔbɔɔ ɛkwan maa nʼabufuo;
    na wamfa wɔn nkwa ankyɛre wɔn
    mmom ɔde wɔn maa ɔyaredɔm.

Ɔpamoo amanaman a wɔwɔ wɔn anim no
    na ɔkyekyɛɛ wɔn nsase no mu maa wɔn sɛ wɔn agyapadeɛ;
    ɔbɔɔ Israel mmusuakuo no atenaseɛ wɔ wɔn afie mu.

Nanso wɔsɔɔ Onyankopɔn hwɛeɛ
    na wɔsɔre tiaa Ɔsorosoroni no;
    na wɔanni ne mmara so.

Ao Onyankopɔn, amanaman no ato ahyɛ wʼagyapadeɛ so;
    wɔagu wʼasɔredan kronkron no ho fi,
    wɔama Yerusalem adane mmubuiɛ.

Mfa yɛn agyanom bɔne so asotwe mma yɛn;
    ma wo mmɔborɔhunu mmra yɛn so ntɛm,
    na yɛwɔ ahohiahia mu.

Ma nneduafoɔ no apinisie nnuru wʼanim;
    fa wo basa ahoɔden no
    kora wɔn a wɔabu wɔn kumfɔ no.

mmɔfra ne nkɔkoaa mpo de wɔn ano
    kamfo wo, wʼatamfoɔ nti;
    na wode bɔ atamfoɔ ne weretɔfoɔ ano.

Ao Israel dwanhwɛfoɔ, tie yɛn,
    wo a wodii Yosef anim sɛdeɛ wɔdi nnwankuo anim;
  wo a wote ahennwa so wɔ Kerubim ntam no, hyerɛn

wɔ Efraim, Benyamin ne Manase anim.
  Kanyane wo tumi;
    bra bɛgye yɛn nkwa.

Ao Onyankopɔn, gye yɛn bio;
    ma wʼanim nhyerɛn yɛn so,
    na wɔagye yɛn nkwa.

Ao Otumfoɔ Onyankopɔn, gye yɛn bio;
    ma wʼanim nhyerɛn yɛn so,
    na wɔagye yɛn nkwa.

Mo ahohiahia mu, mofrɛɛ me na megyee mo,
    megyee mo so wɔ aprannaa mu;
    me sɔɔ mo hwɛeɛ wɔ Meriba nsuo ho.

“Wɔnnim hwee, na wɔnte hwee ase.
    Wɔkyinkyini wɔ esum mu;
    na asase fapem nyinaa woso.

Sɛ wɔfa Baka Bɔnhwa no mu a,
    wɔma hɔ yɛ nsuwansuwa;
    osutɔberɛ nsuo nso de nhyira pii kata asase no so.

Ɛfiri sɛ Awurade Onyankopɔn yɛ owia ne ɛkyɛm;
    Awurade hunu mmɔbɔ na ɔhyɛ animuonyam;
  ɔremfa ade pa biara nkame
    wɔn a wɔteneɛ.

Ao Awurade, aman a woakyekyere nyinaa
    bɛba abɛsom wo wɔ wʼanim;
    wɔbɛba abɛhyɛ wo din animuonyam.

Ao Onyankopɔn, ahomasofoɔ ato ahyɛ me so;
    basabasayɛfoɔ kuo repɛ me akum me,
    nnipa a wɔmmfa wo nyɛ hwee no.

Dane wʼani hwɛ me na dom me;
    fa wʼahoɔden ma wʼakoa
    na gye wʼafenaa babarima nkwa.

Woafa me nnamfonom a wɔbɛn me afiri me nkyɛn
    woama me ho ayɛ wɔn ahi.
  Woaka me ahyɛ mu na mentumi nnwane;

awerɛhoɔ ama mʼani so ayɛ kusuu.

  Ao Awurade mesu frɛ wo da biara;
    metrɛ me nsam kyerɛ wo.

Ɔsɛeɛ a ɛnni awieeɛ ato ɔtamfoɔ no,
    woatutu wɔn nkuropɔn;
    na wɔnnkae wɔn bio mpo.

Ma Awurade yɛn Onyankopɔn adom no ntena yɛn so;
    na yɛn nsa ano adwuma nyɛ yie mma yɛn
    aane, yɛn nsa ano adwuma nyɛ yie.

Ɔde ne ntakra bɛkata wo so;
    na ne ntaban ase na wobɛnya dwanekɔbea;
    ne nokorɛ bɛyɛ wo banbɔ ne wo kyɛm.

Ɔbɛfrɛ me, na mɛgye ne so;
    mɛka ne ho wɔ amanehunu mu,
    mɛgye no, na mahyɛ no animuonyam.

Ao Awurade ampa ara,
    wʼatamfoɔ bɛyera;
    na wobɛhwete abɔnefoɔ nyinaa.

Awurade di ɔhene, wɔde tumi ahentadeɛ ahyɛ no;
    wɔde tumi ahentadeɛ ahyɛ Awurade
    na wɔde ahoɔden ayɛ nʼakodeɛ.
  Wɔde ewiase atim hɔ pintinn;
    na wɔrentumi ntutu.

Ao Awurade, ɛpo ama wɔn ho so,
    ɛpo ama wɔn nne so;
    ɛpo ama wɔn asorɔkye a ɛbɔ denden no so.

Ao Awurade, wo nhyehyɛeɛ gyina hɔ pintinn;
    kronkronyɛ hyɛ wo fie animuonyam
    daa nyinaa.

Ɔbɛtua wɔn nnebɔne no so ka
    na wɔn amumuyɛ enti, wasɛe wɔn;
    Awurade yɛn Onyankopɔn bɛsɛe wɔn.

Monka nkyerɛ aman nyinaa sɛ, “Awurade di ɔhene.”
    Wɔabɔ asase atim hɔ pintinn na ɛnhinhim;
    ɔde pɛpɛyɛ bɛbu nnipa atɛn.

Momma Awurade, yɛn Onyankopɔn so
    na monsɔre no wɔ ne nan ntiasoɔ anim;
    ɔyɛ kronkron.
